+/* [mv] Pipeline variant bits in the colour-mask key (cmask), so every cache,
+ * recipe and pack that keys on it keeps the variant: MV_CMASK_RT, the draw
+ * has the motion-vector target bound after its colour targets; MV_CMASK_WR,
+ * and writes it (opaque, depth-writing scene draws). */
